OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 10 Aug to Wed 19 AugFA
OL,6,Frelatively settled start to the
OL,7,Fperiod, with mainly dry conditions on
OL,8,FMonday, although with scattered
OL,9,Fshowers across northern areas. Then
OL,10,Fthrough the following week, more
OL,11,Fchangeable changeable conditions are
OL,12,Flikely across northwestern parts, with
OL,13,Fsome spells of rain and stronger winds
OL,14,Finterspersed by drier periods. Whilst
OL,15,Fsoutheastern areas will generally see
OL,16,Fmore settled and drier conditions.
OL,17,FFurther into August, lower pressure
OL,18,Fmay start to track further south south
OL,19,For east. This means there is a greater
OL,20,Fchance of frontal systems or thundery
OL,21,Finterludes to affect southern and
OL,22,Feastern areas in comparison to recent
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fweeks, though rainfall amounts could
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fbe quite variable with some areas
OL,25,Fstill seeing relatively little. For
OL,26,Fthe most part, temperatures look to
