OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 20 Aug to Thu 3 SepFThe
OL,6,Fbroad theme of high pressure remaining
OL,7,Fin place at least close to the UK
OL,8,Fseems most probable, with occasional
OL,9,Fmore unsettled or changeable
OL,10,Finterludes, either resulting from
OL,11,FAtlantic frontal systems or thundery
OL,12,Fplumes. This means that rainfall
OL,13,Famounts overall are more likely to be
OL,14,Fbelow normal than above. Temperatures
OL,15,Fwill probably be above average and
OL,16,Fsome spells of hot weather and
OL,17,Fheatwaves are possible, especially in
OL,18,Fthe south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
